From a0d8523427c7e3632352badd23ee7ff746953e90 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 12:04:53 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 12/18] Record 0.3.0 cumulative, breakdown and worker-scaling
 measurements

Add the cumulative native comparison of the 0.2.0 baseline binary with
round 10, the per-phase breakdown from examples/breakdown.rs (now also
covering traced records), and worker scaling from the new
validation/worker_scaling.py, with a README describing the evidence and
its host. No library code changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
